        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulcrossed is a story-driven visual novel with tactical SRPG battles. You play as a demon bound to a girl, navigating both the grid of combat and the twists of your soul in the world of siphony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043550/extras/c148f672f50de186c514c0947e384162.poster.avif?t=1764144137\" width=500 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043550/extras/c148f672f50de186c514c0947e384162.webm?t=1764144137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043550/extras/c148f672f50de186c514c0947e384162.mp4?t=1764144137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While there are player choices, <i>Soulcrossed</i> is primarily a linear story. Its focus lies in storytelling mixed with tactical combat. Each encounter is designed as a puzzle, where true victory comes from strategy and adaptation rather than raw power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel + tactical SRPG hybrid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, puzzle-like battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 major bosses plus a final boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art and an original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
